&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;ⅰ）最大55億円程度の与信関連費用増加&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;ⅱ）最大5億円程度の建物毀損の発生&lt;/p&gt;
