  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingSubordinatedBondsPayableTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; text-align: left; text-indent: -24px"&gt;※10．社債には&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;、&lt;/span&gt;劣後特約付社債が含まれております&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 648px"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 240px"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 204px"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 204px"/&gt;
